> +
> +	if (status == SDW_SLAVE_ATTACHED && slave->dev_num > 0)

do you actually need to test if slave->dev_num is > 0?

if I look at drivers/soundwire/bus.c, update_status cannot really be
invoked with dev_num == 0.

